WEBVTT

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.820
Rito-kun, are you doing well?

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.370
It's Run!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.040
I've been a little lonely since I've been so busy with work and can't see you.{I've been pretty busy with work lately and haven't been able to see you, so I'm a little lonely.}

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:29.510
But I promised to improve myself as an idol in order to get you to look at me, Rito-kun.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:30.880
I'll give it my all!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.780
By the way, today is the first Magical
Kyouko shoot I've done in quite some time.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:41.220
It's about Blue Metallia's reappearance after having been
defeated by Magical Kyouko and leaving The Organisation.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.060
Make sure you watch when it broadcasts!

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.670
Wow, this outfit is a little tight.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.550
I wonder if it's because I ate so many cream puffs in the dressing room?

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.070
I have to be more careful.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.350
Run!

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.530
We're about to start shooting!

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.450
Yes!

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.580
I'll be right there!{I'm coming now!}

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:07.670
Since I sent Rito-kun that text,
I have to show him how cool I am!

