<b>Magical Kyouko Flame」</b>

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.330
<b>Magical Kyouko Flame」</b>

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.830
Blue Metallia-san, please stand over here.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:12.900
Yes!

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.260
Do your best, Run!

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.270
Ready... and action!

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:30.610
It can't be!

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:34.920
Pierogi has been revived as a cyborg!?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.140
It's all thanks to my power as the Magician Count!

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.200
Now go, Pierogi Omega!

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.320
Blue Metallia!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.920
It's been a long time.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.340
I won't let you lay a hand on Kyouko.

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:59.090
Because I will be the one to defeat her!

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.820
Damned traitor!

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.100
You guys, do it!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.100
This is the first action scene I've had in a while!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.740
I have to give it my all!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.770
Rito-kun will be watching!

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:16.740
Run, those moves are incredible...

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.080
Eh!?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.210
Oh no, I moved too quickly!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.380
Kyouko?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:36.710
It's okay, nobody noticed other than me!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.050
Keep going, just like this!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.030
Huh?

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.380
Is Kyouko-chan ad-libbing?

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:45.210
This isn't in the script{different from the script}; Kyouko isn't supposed to fight here.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.210
Should we stop them, director?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:48.480
Hm...

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.390
No.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:54.720
Former rivals fighting back-to-back...

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.980
This is great!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.530
Keep shooting!

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:12.010
Kyouko-chan, Run-chan...

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:14.340
I... I can't...

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.550
I can't hold back any more!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.340
Principal!?

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.880
Wait, why is he inside Pierogi!?

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.890
Stand back, Blue Metallia!

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:30.100
Magical Flame!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.600
Gah!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.860
It can't be!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.030
Once again, the conflict is resolved by burning!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.410
How did he slip in here?

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.010
What should we do, director?

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.500
We don't have a spare outfit, do we?

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.000
No choice.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.920
<b>Shower Room</b>

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.920
<b>Shower Room</b>

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.920
I want to keep that scene with Kyouko and Metallia so we'll use it as-is.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.890
Change the script accordingly!

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:01.880
Got it!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:09.040
You're really amazing, Kyouko!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.390
To be able to cover that up by ad-libbing.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.980
Thanks to you, I was saved.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.900
Don't worry about it.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:26.740
So Run-san, you were thinking about Rito-kun during your performance today, weren't you?

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:28.450
No way!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:29.960
How did you know?

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.350
It was obvious!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.290
You were so fired up!

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:37.460
But you put a little too much into it, and they broke free. {ribbing her for her tits popping out}

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.250
What?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:46.400
I'm glad you're trying to improve yourself for Rito-kun's sake,{It's good that}

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:49.640
but you have to be careful when you're performing.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:52.660
I thought I'd try acting like your senior for a bit.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.520
Well...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.240
It's not like I don't understand the feeling, though.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.990
I guess I should help her out as her friend.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.130
Rito-san?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.940
The Magical Kyouko that Run-san is on is about to start!

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:33.850
It seems Run-san's job is going pretty well.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:38.820
So how does it feel to have a monopoly on an idol's heart?

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.270
Don't tease me!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.270
Once again, the conflict is resolved by burning!

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.210
Kyouko-chan and Run-chan are so cool!

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.720
Why was the principal in this?!

