00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:13.840
...Kirisaki Kyouko-san to speak about her work in the entertainment business!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:16.850
Thank you very much!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.650
Kirisaki Kyouko Special Guest Speech sponsored by the Sainan High Student Council

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.650
Working in the entertainment industry seems pretty tough.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.240
But it also seems kind of fun.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.270
Eh?

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:35.240
You have to sing and dance in front of people.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:40.170
But I wonder why Magical Kyouko is suddenly visiting our school?

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.770
That's a good question.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.590
How can an idol as busy as her...?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.180
Kirisaki Kyouko...

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:52.530
If I remember correctly, she had already met Rito-san through Run-san's agency.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:53.890
Could I be...

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.430
...over thinking this?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:01.150
Momo-chan, are you thinking of having her join the harem too?

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.960
W-What are you talking about!?

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.620
Nothing!

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:05.490
Just a game.

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.360
We're talking about a game.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.960
What kind of game are you talking about playing?

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.650
Mea!

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.620
This malice is wonderful!

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.400
Guide you through Sainan High?

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.600
Yeah.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.460
Kyouko-san said she wanted to see it while she has the chance.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.440
Run-san is off today because she has a recording,

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:29.330
so she said she wanted to ask you
because you were acquainted, Yuuki-kun.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.220
Is that okay?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.420
Y-Yeah, sure.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.220
If all she wanted was someone she knew, there's Ren too...

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.720
I wonder if she's sure about this?{I wonder if I'm good enough}

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.300
I'm sorry.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.260
I would like to accompany you as well,

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.730
but I really must get back to the agency.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.340
I told you, I'll be fine by myself.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:48.460
It'll be okay, Yuuki-kun is a very reliable person.{he will reliably fall into your pantsu}

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.660
All right then, please take care of me!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:53.610
Yeah.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.980
Why is he with Kyouko-chan?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.010
I'm jealous...

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.520
I want to be with her too...

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.940
That damned Rito!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.430
Why does he always get to do these things?!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.850
I'm so jealous!

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.520
All these stares kind of hurt...

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.830
Are you sure it's okay for me to do this?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.610
Of course.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.700
Rather, that was the goal from the start!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.570
Eh?

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.200
You're giving a speech?

