Lala-sama, it seems like something noisy is going on out there.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.830
Rito and Kyouko-chan?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.640
It seems they're being chased.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.590
Oh no!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.590
Ah, Rito-san.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.560
Momo!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.270
They just won't give up!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.190
Rito!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.970
Kyouko-chan!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:16.610
I finished something good that can help with that!{OH GOD THIS IS NOT GOING TO HELP!}

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:17.310
Lala!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.520
It's perfect for hide-and-seek!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.520
Gone-Gone-Hoop-Kun!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.940
Go ahead!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.860
A huge success!{inb4 no clothes wherever they appear}

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:37.090
When you pass through this, it searches for a place
where you'll be difficult to find, and warps you there!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:39.580
But Onee-sama,

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.670
your clothes are left behind when you pass through...{your clothes still disappear in the middle...}

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.090
Eh?

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:49.120
I wonder where Lala-chi went in such a hurry?

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.650
Wasn't it the restroom?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.220
T-That Lala!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:16:02.350
This is no different from Pyon-Pyon-Warp-Kun!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.850
What's more, the situation is only getting worse!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.700
If we're spotted now...!

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:22.560
Rito-kun, move your leg.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.500
Ah, sorry.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.000
It's so cramped in here I can't move much.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.900
Don't move!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.700
I-I'm sorry...!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.000
So embarrassing.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:01.420
Rito-kun's body is so hard.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.530
And also...

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.210
It's so hot...

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.470
T-The sweat!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.100
Calm down!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.600
This is no time to get excited!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.290
If we're discovered, this will turn into a huge scandal!{become a scandal for Kyouko-chan!}

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.550
Not to mention, Haruna-chan is out there!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:45.960
Kyouko-chan kind of looks like
Haruna-chan when she lets her hair down.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:52.600
Idiot!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.380
Stop thinking of things like that!

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:58.970
What is it?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.310
I thought I just heard a sound from inside there.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.580
Oh no!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.930
Someone in there?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.860
Oh no!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:12.770
Oh no!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:13.690
Oh no!

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:25.180
What's this smoke!?

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:26.350
Is there a fire!?

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:29.460
Everyone, hurry and get into the hallway!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.680
Rito-san, Kyouko-san.

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:33.960
I brought your clothes.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.050
Hurry up while you have the chance.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.050
Momo!

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.590
You saved us.

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:46.230
How did you know we'd be there?

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:50.560
We had Nana's pet track your scent, Rito-san.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.320
You're always ending up naked, Senpai.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.100
How wonderful.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.290
It's such a pain to help you out.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.570
I'm glad we managed to make it in time.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:03.060
I'm...

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.310
...going home!

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:07.290
Kyouko-chan!

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:09.960
Oh, my.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.000
It looks like she hates you, Senpai.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.010
Well of course she would hate this beast.

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:16.410
Why don't I comfort you?

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.400
Wha-?!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.630
Mea!

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:22.310
Kirisaki Kyouko...

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:25.030
I would have liked to talk to her a little...

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.560
Oh, well.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.560
So you went home after that yesterday?

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:33.340
Yeah.

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:34.310
I see.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:40.750
Ever since childhood, I've been put through some rough things because of Lala-chan's inventions.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:44.450
Though, the part about the principal and getting mobbed for autographs sounds pretty terrible.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:47.260
Is something wrong?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.300
N-Nothing!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.700
It sure was.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:50.830
They really got me.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:21.970
Prince...

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:28.200
He really got me...

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>「Adhesion</b>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>「Adhesion</b>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>~But No Malice~」</b>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.870
<b>~But No Malice~」</b>

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.220
And when Mea-san was cutting vegetables,

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:43.390
some kind of switch flipped and she went out of control.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.720
I see.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:50.370
It was horrible...

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.310
My little sister seems to be causing you trouble.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:55.200
Little sister?

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:07.860
What is that?!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:08.770
A monster?!

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.290
Stand back, Mikan!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:18.470
I don't know how you got in, but don't come any closer-

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.130
Huh?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.610
Oh, so that's where you were, Meda-Q.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.380
Yami-oneechan is here, too!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.630
Nana-san, Mea-san!

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.000
Nana, what is "Meda-Q"?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.850
Oh, that's his name.

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:37.620
When I went with Momo to collect plants on planet Tentac,

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:40.920
I met him and we became friends.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.320
As expected of Nana-chan!

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:44.520
Isn't that right, Meda-Q?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.770
Huh, what is it?

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:51.080
You like Yami?

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.160
You want her to hug you?

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.160
I guess it can't be helped.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:10.910
Sorry about that.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.720
He's spoiled.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.020
I-It's fine...

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:21.020
Y-Yami-san, you're not good with slimy things, right?

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:22.140
Are you okay?

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:25.070
I-I can't really say I'm okay.

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:29.470
If this were an enemy, I'd chop it in half.

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:31.170
That's not good.

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:33.670
Why don't you ask Nana-san to take him back?

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:35.290
T-That's a good idea.

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:37.200
Um...

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:38.070
Could you-

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:40.970
Isn't that nice for you, Meda-Q?

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:44.540
I felt bad for him because his mother died.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:46.560
He just wants to be spoiled.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:49.360
Huh?

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:50.900
Is something wrong?

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:53.330
No, it's nothing.

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:55.310
Yami-san, so admirable.

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:57.050
We're home!

00:22:57.050 --> 00:23:01.350
Mikan, I bought some taiyaki while we were out shopping.

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:01.940
Oh.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.330
Yami, you're here too?

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:05.990
What's that creature?

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:16.340
Ah!

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:19.210
Meda-Q, you can't eat that!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.580
Something slimy is...!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:58.680
Yami-san!

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:03.370
Meda-Q loves sweets, and when he eats them, he wraps himself around whoever's close by.

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:06.660
Eh?

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:08.220
Wai- Wait!

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:10.420
Rito, help me!

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:10.420
Mikan!

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:18.380
Wai- Rito, don't cling to me!

00:24:18.380 --> 00:24:21.070
Even if you say that, I can't get off.

00:24:23.670 --> 00:24:27.070
Don't breathe into my ear!

00:24:28.780 --> 00:24:29.720
Wow!

00:24:29.720 --> 00:24:31.530
The two of them are so bold!

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:32.360
How wonderful!

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:34.400
I want to get tangled up, too!

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:36.300
What are you saying!?

00:24:36.300 --> 00:24:40.660
Momo, do something to sedate Meda-Q until he turns back to normal!

00:24:40.660 --> 00:24:42.010
You mean with a Kenja flower?

00:24:42.010 --> 00:24:43.030
Got it.

00:24:43.030 --> 00:24:44.060
Eh?

00:24:44.060 --> 00:24:45.260
It's fine, isn't it?

00:24:45.260 --> 00:24:46.790
They look like they're having fun.

00:24:46.790 --> 00:24:48.800
Right, Yami-oneechan?

00:24:52.720 --> 00:24:54.220
Huh?

00:24:56.550 --> 00:25:00.790
Yami-oneechan, you're not good with slimy things?

00:25:00.790 --> 00:25:01.390
Right.

00:25:01.390 --> 00:25:02.700
Good grief.

00:25:02.700 --> 00:25:04.840
Didn't you know that, Nana?

00:25:04.840 --> 00:25:06.780
I forgot too, though...

00:25:06.780 --> 00:25:09.080
Is that so?

00:25:09.080 --> 00:25:10.320
I'm sorry, Yami.

00:25:10.650 --> 00:25:11.860
You too, Mikan.

00:25:11.860 --> 00:25:13.150
But why?

00:25:13.660 --> 00:25:15.320
Is there some reason?

00:25:15.700 --> 00:25:19.300
Long ago, when I had just become an assassin,

00:25:20.130 --> 00:25:23.200
I got lost on a certain planet with tentacled creatures...

00:25:25.300 --> 00:25:28.090
No, I don't want to talk about this any more.

00:25:28.090 --> 00:25:28.980
I want to know.

00:25:28.980 --> 00:25:29.840
I want to know!

00:25:30.820 --> 00:25:33.850
So, Yami-oneechan has that sort of weakness...

00:25:33.850 --> 00:25:37.770
If there was an enemy who used that,

00:25:37.770 --> 00:25:39.510
she would lose her life, wouldn't she?

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:44.580
Onee-chan, who is supposed to be the ultimate trans weapon...

00:25:44.580 --> 00:25:46.470
I don't like it!

00:25:56.460 --> 00:25:58.870
It's been a long time, Golden Darkness!

00:25:58.870 --> 00:26:02.870
I've been told that you're weak against slimy things!

00:26:03.690 --> 00:26:05.090
Azenda the Tyrant...

00:26:05.090 --> 00:26:09.130
It looks like it was worth breaking out of the galactic prison.

00:26:09.130 --> 00:26:14.170
I have enough special lotion on this bio-whip to make it plenty slimy-

00:26:16.370 --> 00:26:16.840
Huh?

00:26:18.920 --> 00:26:20.550
Victory goes to those who act first.

00:26:21.580 --> 00:26:25.090
Azenda, I'll say this right now.

00:26:25.090 --> 00:26:28.170
If you ever try anything with Mikan again, I really will kill you.

00:26:28.170 --> 00:26:29.320
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:26:29.320 --> 00:26:31.380
I got too carried away.

00:26:31.380 --> 00:26:34.570
Looks like there was no reason to worry.
